# Generated from app.html by scripts/gen-native-template.mjs on every build-native*.
/src/app.native.html

# Capacitor native projects (generated by `npx cap add <platform>`).
# `android/` is now tracked (Faza 3b): we customise native config (deep-link
# intent-filters) and head toward a store release, so it is the durable,
# reviewable source of truth. Its own nested `android/.gitignore` (Capacitor's
# standard template) keeps build artifacts, `local.properties`, copied web
# assets and generated config out. IDE state is excluded here. Keystore/signing
# material arrives in Faza 5 - add `*.jks`/`*.keystore` ignores then.
/android/.idea/
# iOS project is still spike-generated (added in Faza 4) - keep it ignored.
/ios
